      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Modulo \\(x^2-2,\\) we have \\(x^2\\equiv2,\\) so \\(x^3-2\\equiv2x-2.\\) This linear polynomial is the remainder.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E.",
